         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hey there.",
         "transl": "Na du."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...You seem kinda lost...",
         "transl": "... Du wirkst irgendwie verloren..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "If you're waiting for somebody, this is the right spot.",
         "transl": "Wenn du auf jemanden wartest, ist das hier der richtige Ort."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Pretty much everyone here is waiting for new players arriving from Cross Central.",
         "transl": "So ziemlich jeder hier wartet auf neue Spieler, die aus der CrossCentral anreisen."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "It's a popular meetup spot.",
         "transl": "Ist einfach ein beliebter Treffpunkt."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... You seem to be a new player, too. So you know what I mean, right?",
         "transl": "... Du scheinst auch ein neuer Spieler zu sein, also weißt du, was ich meine, oder?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...You're a quiet one, I see.",
         "transl": "... Eher der stille Typ, verstehe."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.triblader-female-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
