     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hey!\\. Over here!",
       "transl": "Hey!\\. Hier drüben!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Look at all these old style buildings!",
       "transl": "Schau dir mal die alten Häuschen hier an!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It's like we are in some kind of medieval fantasy world, non?",
       "transl": "Wie in einer mittelalterlichen Fantasy-Welt, non?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So...\\. Right now I'm waiting here to meet a friend. ",
       "transl": "Also...\\. Im Moment warte ich hier auf einen Freund."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But I haven't seen him so far.",
       "transl": "Aber ich habe ihn bisher nicht gesehen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "There are just so many people here...",
       "transl": "Hier sind einfach so viele Menschen..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "MOPING"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "HOLERÖ!\\.\\.",
       "transl": "HOLERÖ!\\.\\."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Eeek!",
       "transl": "Ahhh!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Gyahahaha!",
       "transl": "Gyahahaha!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "LAUGH"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SCARED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Sacrebleu!\\. Was that really necessary?",
       "transl": "Sacrebleu!\\. Musste das sein?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "EXHAUSTED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, very necessary.",
       "transl": "Japp, musste es."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I see you brought a friend?",
       "transl": "Ich sehe, du hast eine Freundin mitgebracht?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "TOWARDS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Ah oui, that's Lea!\\. I met her during the tutorial.",
       "transl": "Ah oui, das ist Lea!\\. Ich habe sie während des Tutorials getroffen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hi!",
       "transl": "Привіт!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "And this dark lord meanie here is \\c[3]Lukas\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Und dieser Fürst von und zu Fieserich hier ist \\c[3]Lukas\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Also known as \\c[3]Schneider\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Auch bekannt als \\c[3]Schneider\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Nice to meet you, Lea!",
       "transl": "Schön, dich kennenzulernen, Lea!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[nickt]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So you finally reached the \\c[3]Croissant\\c[0].\\. Having fun so far?",
       "transl": "Dann seid ihr jetzt also auch auf dem \\c[3]Croissant\\c[0].\\. Gefällt es euch so weit?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "TOWARDS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Oui, énormément!",
       "transl": "Oui, énormément!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Wait...\\. Croissant?",
       "transl": "Moment...\\. Croissant?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "The mainland.\\. You'll get the idea once you see the map.",
       "transl": "Das Festland.\\. Du wirst es verstehen, sobald du die Karte siehst."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "WINK"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Anyway, this is \\c[3]Rookie Harbor\\c[0].\\. It's known for the incoming shipments of rookies like you.",
       "transl": "Jedenfalls seid ihr gerade in \\c[3]Rookie Harbor\\c[0].\\. Diese Stadt ist für regelmäßigen Nachschub an Neulingen wie euch bekannt."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It's also a fairly big place, which tends to be confusing for said rookies.",
       "transl": "Es ist ein recht großer Ort, was besagte Neulinge oftmals sehr verwirrt."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "WONDERING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So I thought I'd give you a small tour!",
       "transl": "Also habe ich mir überlegt, euch eine kleine Führung zu geben!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Très bien!\\. Lead the way!\n",
       "transl": "Très bien!\\. Dann geh mal voran!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
